cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AllocLab: control allocation for over-actuated spacecraft effector sets"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmAcharya-avtr/alloclab"
abstract: >-
  Thruster-cluster and reaction-wheel effector models with a general control
  effectiveness matrix; pseudo-inverse, weighted pseudo-inverse, redistributed
  pseudo-inverse, linear-programming and quadratic-programming allocation with
  actuator bounds; exact attainable-moment-set geometry with closed-form
  cross-checks; effector-failure reallocation that reports infeasibility
  explicitly; and a scikit-learn surrogate of the QP allocator benchmarked
  against the exact solver on allocation error, constraint satisfaction and
  runtime. Research-grade, not flight-qualified.
keywords:
  - control allocation
  - attainable moment set
  - reaction wheel
  - thruster
  - aerospace
